{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "Golden query set for NFR-3 (first-result accuracy). 50 baseline queries across 18 packs (CI gate for v1.0) + 18 adversarial queries (WS-A.1 baseline; expected-failing until the normalized ranker rewrite in 5.3 lands). Authored 2026-06-21 (25 baseline) + 2026-06-24 (25 baseline) + 2026-06-29 (18 adversarial).",
    "rules": "Per query: assert expected_first is at rank 1, and every id in acceptable_top3 is within the top 3. expected_first=null asserts the zero-result state renders (FR-S9). Adversarial queries (adversarial: true) have expected_first pinned to the CURRENT ranker's top-1 and a _comment documenting the target behavior the rewrite must produce; they are not part of the CI gate until 5.4 wires them in.",
    "target_count_v1": 50,
    "target_count_v1_1": 200,
    "adversarial_count": 18,
    "draft_count": 68,
    "scope": "git (10) + docker (5) + kubectl (4) + gh (3) + curl (3) + aws-cli (2) + bash (2) + jq (2) + make (2) + nginx (2) + pnpm (2) + psql (2) + python (2) + ripgrep (2) + ssh (2) + systemctl (2) + terraform (1) + tmux (1) + zero-match (2) + adversarial (18)."
  },
