      "_comment": "currently ranks kubectl-logs because the typo 'roolout' prevents intent match. 5.3 rewrite must use fuzzy rescue and return kubectl-rollout-restart — fuzzy should help typo queries but stay behind exact/prefix/alias matches for the second token."
