      "_comment": "currently passes (git-reset-soft-head-1 ranks first) by accident. 5.3 rewrite must preserve this AND make it explicit via alias match — the rewrite must add 'undo last commit' as an alias on git-reset-soft-head-1 so the result is robust to pack content changes."
    },
